  "name": "sMRIPrep",
  "alternateName": [
    "Structural MRI PREProcessing"
  ],
  "description": "Structural MRI preprocessing pipeline from the NiPreps ecosystem. Performs skull stripping, tissue segmentation, and spatial normalisation across diverse scanner protocols with minimal user input. Built on Nipype, integrates FSL, ANTs, FreeSurfer, and Connectome Workbench. BIDS-compliant with visual QC reports. Serves as the shared anatomical preprocessing backbone for fMRIPrep and dMRIPrep. Apache-2.0, 166 stars, v0.19.1 (September 2025).",
